    {
      "title": "Core decisions",
      "level": 2,
      "scope": "locale",
      "intro": "",
      "columns": {
        "en": 0,
        "target": 1,
        "use": 2,
        "notes": 3
      },
      "terms": [
        {
          "en": "programming / coding",
          "target": "προγραμματισμός",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Use consistently. \"coding\" occasionally appears as a casual English loanword; do not mix it in with `προγραμματισμός` in one document.",
          "anchor": "term-programming-coding"
        },
        {
          "en": "developer",
          "target": "προγραμματιστής",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Standard Greek equivalent. English \"developer\" also appears in job titles/marketing but does not displace this in prose.",
          "anchor": "term-developer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Values & data types",
      "level": 3,
      "scope": "locale",
      "intro": "",
      "columns": {
        "en": 0,
        "target": 1,
        "use": 2,
        "notes": 3
      },
      "terms": [
        {
          "en": "value",
          "target": "τιμή",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Ordinary word; also embedded in `λογική τιμή` and `τιμή επιστροφής` below.",
          "anchor": "term-value"
        },
        {
          "en": "number",
          "target": "αριθμός",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Ordinary word.",
          "anchor": "term-number"
        },
        {
          "en": "true / false",
          "target": "αληθής / ψευδής",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Not capitalised in prose.",
          "anchor": "term-true-false"
        },
        {
          "en": "character",
          "target": "χαρακτήρας",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-character"
        },
        {
          "en": "integer",
          "target": "ακέραιος (αριθμός)",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-integer"
        },
        {
          "en": "float / decimal",
          "target": "δεκαδικός (αριθμός)",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-float-decimal"
        },
        {
          "en": "string",
          "target": "συμβολοσειρά",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Preferred over the school curriculum's `αλφαριθμητικό`, which implies \"alphanumeric\" and is less accurate for the general concept.",
          "anchor": "term-string"
        },
        {
          "en": "Boolean",
          "target": "λογική τιμή",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Literally \"logical value\"; well established and unambiguous, no English loanword tension found for this term in Greek.",
          "anchor": "term-boolean"
        },
        {
          "en": "array",
          "target": "πίνακας",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "**Never confuse with the \"whiteboard\" metaphor below**, which must always be written as `ασπροπίνακας`/`λευκός πίνακας`, never bare `πίνακας`.",
          "anchor": "term-array"
        },
        {
          "en": "list",
          "target": "λίστα",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Used where the source itself distinguishes \"list\" from \"array\".",
          "anchor": "term-list"
        },
        {
          "en": "dictionary",
          "target": "λεξικό",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-dictionary"
        },
        {
          "en": "element",
          "target": "στοιχείο",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Array element = `στοιχείο του πίνακα`.",
          "anchor": "term-element"
        },
        {
          "en": "index",
          "target": "θέση",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Not `δείκτης`, which is reserved for \"pointer\", a different concept in Greek CS.",
          "anchor": "term-index"
        },
        {
          "en": "key-value pair",
          "target": "ζεύγος κλειδιού-τιμής",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-key-value-pair"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Functions & control flow",
      "level": 3,
      "scope": "locale",
      "intro": "",
      "columns": {
        "en": 0,
        "target": 1,
        "use": 2,
        "notes": 3
      },
      "terms": [
        {
          "en": "if statement",
          "target": "δομή επιλογής",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Official curriculum term (\"selection structure\").",
          "anchor": "term-if-statement"
        },
        {
          "en": "condition",
          "target": "συνθήκη",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Ordinary word; stands alone.",
          "anchor": "term-condition"
        },
        {
          "en": "comparison",
          "target": "σύγκριση",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Ordinary word; stands alone.",
          "anchor": "term-comparison"
        },
        {
          "en": "expression",
          "target": "έκφραση",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-expression"
        },
        {
          "en": "operator",
          "target": "τελεστής",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "e.g. `τελεστές σύγκρισης` (comparison operators).",
          "anchor": "term-operator"
        },
        {
          "en": "statement (executable)",
          "target": "εντολή",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "The imperative sense: a line of code that does something and gets executed.",
          "anchor": "term-statement"
        },
        {
          "en": "statement (logical claim)",
          "target": "πρόταση",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "The proposition sense: a claim that is true or false. Pick by meaning, not by the English word.",
          "anchor": "term-statement-2"
        },
        {
          "en": "function",
          "target": "συνάρτηση",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "The *keyword* `function` in code stays English; the concept in prose is `συνάρτηση`.",
          "anchor": "term-function"
        },
        {
          "en": "to call (a function)",
          "target": "καλεί",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "`καλεί μια συνάρτηση`",
          "anchor": "term-to-call"
        },
        {
          "en": "to define (a function)",
          "target": "ορίζει",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-to-define"
        },
        {
          "en": "parameter",
          "target": "παράμετρος",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "The declaration-site name.",
          "anchor": "term-parameter"
        },
        {
          "en": "argument",
          "target": "όρισμα",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "The call-site value.",
          "anchor": "term-argument"
        },
        {
          "en": "input (to a function)",
          "target": "είσοδος",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-input"
        },
        {
          "en": "output",
          "target": "έξοδος",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-output"
        },
        {
          "en": "to return (a value)",
          "target": "επιστρέφει",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-to-return"
        },
        {
          "en": "return value",
          "target": "τιμή επιστροφής",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Keep distinct from the verb above.",
          "anchor": "term-return-value"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Loops, state & program flow",
      "level": 3,
      "scope": "locale",
      "intro": "",
      "columns": {
        "en": 0,
        "target": 1,
        "use": 2,
        "notes": 3
      },
      "terms": [
        {
          "en": "keyword",
          "target": "λέξη-κλειδί",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Chosen over the more technical `δεσμευμένη λέξη` for the friendlier beginner tone; both terms exist in real usage.",
          "anchor": "term-keyword"
        },
        {
          "en": "variable",
          "target": "μεταβλητή",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-variable"
        },
        {
          "en": "assignment",
          "target": "ανάθεση",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "`εντολή ανάθεσης` = assignment statement.",
          "anchor": "term-assignment"
        },
        {
          "en": "to assign",
          "target": "αναθέτει",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-to-assign"
        },
        {
          "en": "code block",
          "target": "ενότητα κώδικα",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Least standardised of these terms in real Greek sources; revisit with native-speaker feedback if it reads awkwardly in practice.",
          "anchor": "term-code-block"
        },
        {
          "en": "error",
          "target": "σφάλμα",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-error"
        },
        {
          "en": "exception",
          "target": "εξαίρεση",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Keep distinct from `σφάλμα` (error), the general term.",
          "anchor": "term-exception"
        },
        {
          "en": "nested",
          "target": "εμφωλευμένος",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "e.g. `εμφωλευμένος βρόχος` = nested loop.",
          "anchor": "term-nested"
        },
        {
          "en": "iteration",
          "target": "επανάληψη",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Same word covers \"loop\" as a general concept; context disambiguates.",
          "anchor": "term-iteration"
        },
        {
          "en": "to run / execute (code)",
          "target": "εκτελεί",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-to-run-execute"
        },
        {
          "en": "loop",
          "target": "βρόχος",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "The general \"repetition\" concept is `επανάληψη`, reinforced by the Greek-keyword `ΓΛΩΣΣΑ` pseudocode taught in schools.",
          "anchor": "term-loop"
        },
        {
          "en": "for loop",
          "target": "for βρόχος",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Keep `for` in backticks (real keyword) + `βρόχος`.",
          "anchor": "term-for-loop"
        },
        {
          "en": "while loop",
          "target": "while βρόχος",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "As above.",
          "anchor": "term-while-loop"
        },
        {
          "en": "loop body",
          "target": "σώμα του βρόχου",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-loop-body"
        },
        {
          "en": "scope",
          "target": "εμβέλεια",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "`τοπική εμβέλεια` = local scope, `καθολική εμβέλεια` = global scope.",
          "anchor": "term-scope"
        },
        {
          "en": "class",
          "target": "κλάση",
          "use": "el",
          "notes": "Dominant in OOP-specific teaching over the older, more generic `τάξη`.",
          "anchor": "term-class"
        },
        {
          "en": "method",
          "target": "μέθοδος",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-method"
        },
        {
          "en": "property",
          "target": "ιδιότητα",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-property"
        },
        {
          "en": "object",
          "target": "αντικείμενο",
          "use": "el",
          "anchor": "term-object"
        }
      ]
    },
